# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# KAIRÓS — MER Church Platform  |  Local Development Environment Variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# HOW TO USE:
#   1. Copy this file to `.env` in the project root
#   2. Fill in the values from your OnSpace Cloud backend
#   3. Run: npm install && npm run dev
#
# WHERE TO FIND THE VALUES:
#   - Open your project on OnSpace
#   - Click the "Cloud" button (right panel)
#   - Go to Settings → API → Project URL & Anon Key
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# OnSpace Cloud / Supabase Backend URL
# Example: https://xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx.backend.onspace.ai
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=your_backend_url_here

# OnSpace Cloud / Supabase Anonymous Public Key (safe to expose in frontend)
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_anon_key_here
